; SupplyDemandPriceActionEA v2 - GOLD (XAUUSD) ONLY preset
; ForexSymbol is left empty so this instance trades only Gold.
; Gold is fast and volatile: smaller risk, stronger impulse requirement,
; slightly wider zone tolerance. Run on an XAUUSD M15 chart.
; If running a second (EURUSD) instance too, give it a different MagicBase.
; ENUM_TIMEFRAMES values: M15=15  M30=30  H1=16385  H4=16388  D1=16408
